OL,3,GNEWSAStuntman-turned-filmmaker
OL,4,Ashowcases city in new film
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Birmingham stuntman-turned-filmmaker
OL,7,Fsaid he wants to show the city in a new
OL,8,Flight in his new action film, Lotus.
OL,10,FPhilip Ray Tommy, who has worked as a
OL,11,Fstunt performer on major productions
OL,12,Fincluding Spider-Man, Jurassic World
OL,13,FRebirth and Gladiator 2, wrote and
OL,14,Fdirected the Birmingham-made film.
OL,16,FIt features Birmingham landmarks
OL,17,Fincluding the Council House, St
OL,18,FMartin's Church, Selfridges and the
OL,19,FRotunda, which is shown being destroyed
OL,20,Fin a visual-effects sequence.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
