OL,3,GNEWSAStuntman-turned-filmmaker
OL,4,Ashowcases city in new film
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The city is beautiful when it looks
OL,7,Fthrough the right lens. Our biggest aim
OL,8,Fwas to show it in a different way,
OL,9,F[one] that it's not normally seen in,
OL,10,Fand to show some kind of real polish to
OL,11,Fthe place, " he said.
